stderr '^releasenotes: CHANGELOG.md: the 0.0.1 section is empty$'

! exec releasenotes CHANGELOG.md
stderr '^usage: releasenotes CHANGELOG VERSION$'

! exec releasenotes missing.md v0.2.0
stderr '^releasenotes: open missing.md: '

